(text "R-channel clock tree (bom 1.1): identical to the L tree on the FPGA sheet. XOCLK (global, from Y301/Y302 via 33 R each) -> R350 33 R -> U303 LMK1C1108 root -> 8 x 33 R -> U330..U337 leaves -> 64 x 33 R -> MCLKR01..64 (R CELL sheets). OE pull-up R351; 100n per VDD pin; V33CLK rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e0956603-1c0e-4538-85dc-c17bc2b32e84"))
